* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_ips (reference/crafted.toml, 5 Nov 2026): an inter-period
* storage process added to TIMES_Demo demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86, CC BY 4.0),
* for M1.3 changes 19 and 19b (docs/m13-plan.md):
* - STKOIL1 stores crude OIL from period to period (PRC_MAP STK; OIL is its primary
*   group, so ppmain.mod L80-96 makes it PRC_STGIPS): EQ_STGIPS (eqstgips.mod), N rows
*   and, with STG_CHRG before the first period, the IN row.
* - INDCO2 is an auxiliary output tied to the storage level (PRC_ACTFLO): EQ_STGAUX
*   with the inter-period terms (eqstgaux.mod L25-32).
* - REG1 is not vintaged, REG2 is (PRC_VINT): both branches of eqstgips.mod L22-23.
* - STG_LOSS 2% a year: the loss factors of both equations.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
SET PRC
/
STKOIL1
/

SET PRC_MAP
/
REG1.STK.STKOIL1
REG2.STK.STKOIL1
/

SET PRC_TSL
/
REG1.STKOIL1.ANNUAL
REG2.STKOIL1.ANNUAL
/

SET PRC_ACTUNT
/
REG1.STKOIL1.OIL.PJ
REG2.STKOIL1.OIL.PJ
/

SET TOP
/
REG1.STKOIL1.OIL.IN
REG1.STKOIL1.OIL.OUT
REG1.STKOIL1.INDCO2.OUT
REG2.STKOIL1.OIL.IN
REG2.STKOIL1.OIL.OUT
REG2.STKOIL1.INDCO2.OUT
/

SET PRC_VINT
/
REG2.STKOIL1
/

SET PRC_DESC
/
 REG1.STKOIL1 'Crafted: inter-period crude oil storage (TIMES.jl demo12_ips)'
 REG2.STKOIL1 'Crafted: inter-period crude oil storage (TIMES.jl demo12_ips)'
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_COST ' '/
REG1.2005.STKOIL1.MEURO05 5
REG2.2005.STKOIL1.MEURO05 5

/

PARAMETER
NCAP_TLIFE ' '/
REG1.2005.STKOIL1 30
REG2.2005.STKOIL1 30

/

PARAMETER
PRC_CAPACT ' '/
REG1.STKOIL1 1
REG2.STKOIL1 1

/

PARAMETER
STG_LOSS ' '/
REG1.2005.STKOIL1.ANNUAL 0.02
REG2.2005.STKOIL1.ANNUAL 0.02

/

PARAMETER
STG_CHRG ' '/
REG1.2004.STKOIL1.ANNUAL 50
REG2.2004.STKOIL1.ANNUAL 30

/

PARAMETER
PRC_ACTFLO ' '/
REG1.2005.STKOIL1.INDCO2 0.01
REG2.2005.STKOIL1.INDCO2 0.01

/
